flowchart TD
    A([Open App]) --> B[Select Collection\ne.g. Snoopy Mugs]
    B --> C{Filter by tags?}

    C -->|Yes| D[Select one or more tags\ne.g. christmas, red]
    C -->|No| E[View all items in collection]

    D --> F[View filtered items]

    F --> G{Item appears\nin results?}
    E --> G

    G -->|Yes| H[Already own it]
    G -->|No| I[Not in collection]

    H --> J([Don't buy it])
    I --> K([Buy it!])
